silm:instances_papers_20_functorial_transport_chapters_01_functors_as_typed_cross_kg_mappings_sections_02_vetclinic_kg_as_target_category_concrete_anchor silm:hasExample "In 'VetclinicKgAsTargetCategoryConcreteAnchor', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, the clinic's slot for any animal it opens a chart for; not Mittens by household-name; also, the clinic's standard body-mass quality, scaled in kilograms, used uniformly for every patient; also, the clinic's internal chart identifier (chart 4419 in the worked example)." .
